// The Sacred Tree town MVP: a compact clearing ringed by pines, with the
// tree at its center. The supply (sacred_tree_supply.ron) puts the tree's
// wood and stone piles beside it, the elder and the four sprites on its +z
// side and one Wood Gatherer to the west (-x); the east side (+x) is left
// open to build on. Scene x and z are the supply's positions.
//
// The clearing tops a hill in the middle of 256 x 256 m of generated ground
// to dig for stone (Dig Lab's terraces, six layers deep, sloped): a plateau
// 31 m square and 2 m (8 steps) above the ground round it, with cliff
// sides, and a ramp 7 m wide and 8 m long down the middle of its west
// (-x) and east (+x) sides, one per wave lane. The plateau's top is the
// ground's zero, so the clearing stands where it did; the hill and its
// ramps can't be dug. Round its foot the ground stays flat for 10 m.
Scene(id: "sacred-tree", player: "elder", features: [Digging, SlopedGround], dig_layers: Some(6), name: "THE SACRED TREE / TOWN MVP", spawn: (0.0, 0.0, 3.4), industrial: false, instances: [

],
mine: Some((extent: 128.0, seed: 7, hill: Some((plateau: 15, height: 8, ramp_width: 7, ramp_length: 8, foot: 10)))),
// The light through the day and night (the supply's day cycle: dawn at the
// start, dusk at 2:30). Noon is the forest style's light; the moon is dim,
// so the night's own lights matter.
day_cycle: Some((
  dawn: (sunlight: (1.0, 0.68, 0.42), illuminance: 11000.0, ambient: (0.74, 0.70, 0.72), ambient_brightness: 600.0, sky: (0.38, 0.30, 0.27), fog_density: 0.004),
  noon: (sunlight: (1.0, 0.96, 0.88), illuminance: 14000.0, ambient: (0.66, 0.79, 0.92), ambient_brightness: 800.0, sky: (0.16, 0.22, 0.18), fog_density: 0.003),
  dusk: (sunlight: (1.0, 0.52, 0.30), illuminance: 12000.0, ambient: (0.74, 0.62, 0.70), ambient_brightness: 720.0, sky: (0.28, 0.16, 0.17), fog_density: 0.0035),
  midnight: (sunlight: (0.55, 0.68, 1.0), illuminance: 1800.0, ambient: (0.32, 0.42, 0.78), ambient_brightness: 150.0, sky: (0.015, 0.025, 0.06), fog_density: 0.004),
)),
// The night's lights, lit from late afternoon to full in the evening and
// out soon after dawn: the tree's warm glow under its canopy, lighting the
// plaza (its piles and the sprites' idle spot), and lanterns, one each side
// of the top of each ramp (the plateau's edge is 15.5 m out, the ramps 7 m
// wide) and four round the plaza. Drawn only: nothing walks round them.
glow: Some((position: (0.0, 2.6, 0.0), color: (1.0, 0.72, 0.40), intensity: 2000000.0, range: 20.0)),
lanterns: [
(position: (14.6, 0.0, -4.4)), (position: (14.6, 0.0, 4.4)),
(position: (-14.6, 0.0, -4.4)), (position: (-14.6, 0.0, 4.4)),
(position: (3.4, 0.0, 6.4)), (position: (-3.4, 0.0, 6.4)),
(position: (4.6, 0.0, -4.6)), (position: (-4.6, 0.0, -4.6))
],
